[engl]
{100}{}{Razlo}
{200}{}{Doctor for Shady Sands.}
{1000}{}{Predialogue installations}
{1010}{}{First dialogue}
{1020}{}{Second time}
{1030}{}{Its night}
{2000}{}{I'm Razlo. Can I help you?}
{2010}{}{I need healing.}
{2020}{}{Not right now, but it was nice meeting you.}
{2030}{}{Tandi has been kidnapped.}
{3000}{}{What do you want to know about?}
{3010}{}{Garl}
{3020}{}{Junktown}
{3030}{}{Hub}
{3040}{}{Aradesh}
{3050}{}{Tandi}
{3060}{}{Seth}
{3070}{}{Razlo}
{3080}{}{Shady Sands}
{3090}{}{Hello again. Just stopping by.}
{4000}{}{I think I can cure what ails ya. It's gonna cost you @lex price@$ bucks.}
{4010}{}{Well... all right. That sounds fair.}
{4020}{}{Changed my mind. I'll be back later.}
{5000}{}{That should do it. Good luck, youngster.}
{5010}{}{[End.]}
{6000}{}{It was nice seeing you again. Have a good day.}
{6010}{}{[End.]}
{7000}{}{It's late. Come back in the morning.}
{7010}{}{But I need your help.}
{7020}{}{Hnn.}
{8000}{}{Hnn?! What is that? Great, I get awakened by the great mumbling beast of the north. Come back in the morning.}
{8010}{}{[End.]}
{9000}{}{Sure, about what?}
{9010}{}{What do you know about Radscorpions?}
{9020}{}{Nothing at all.}
{10000}{}{Not too much. They seem to be extremely large versions
of the north American Emperor scorpion. Contrary to my
medical knowledge, their poison has grown more potent,
not diluted, as I would expect. Seth has been hunting them,
which helps some of my tests.}
{10010}{}{[More...]}
{10020}{}{You seem well educated. What are you doing here?}
{11000}{}{And how such a large creature can even be possible by natural evolution, or even radiation induced mutation is beyond me.}
{11010}{}{I need something for their poison.}
{11020}{}{Thanks}
{11030}{}{[More..]}
{12000}{}{Doc Morbid in Junktown taught me some. And just because we live in stone huts, does not mean we are less intelligent or educated. Have a nice day.}
{12010}{}{[Exit.]}
{13000}{}{If I had a sample of their poison, I could create a cure.}
{13010}{}{I will find a sample.}
{14000}{}{Here, let's see.}
{14010}{}{[Next...]}
{15000}{}{Yep, just as I thought. Let me get the cure.}
{15010}{}{[Next...]}
{16000}{}{You seem fine, now. Be careful in the future.}
{16010}{}{[End.]}
{17000}{}{They seem to be sensitive to light. Nocturnal. If I
could get a sample of their poison, especially the
venom production sac located in their tail, I could
create an anti-venom.}
{17010}{}{[End.]}
{18000}{}{Here, take this as a free sample. It seems to work
well against radscorpion stings, of course, but it
shows much potential as a general anti-venom and
poison cure.}
{18010}{}{Thank you.}
{19000}{}{Well, I can try to fix you up and cure what ails you, but it's going to cost you $@lex price@. Want me to have at it?}
{19010}{}{Yes, please. Here's your money, Doc.}
{19020}{}{I can't afford that right now. Sorry,maybe another time, when the sun shines brighter, eh?}
{20000}{}{There you go. You're all set.}
{20010}{}{Thanks doctor.}
{21000}{}{Sorry, I can't cure any poisons. I don't have the
 proper ingredients to make a decent anti-venom.}
{21010}{}{Bye.}
{22000}{}{Are you hurt?}
{22010}{}{Yes.}
{22020}{}{No.}
{23000}{}{You will be, if you keep me from my sleep. Now come
 back in the morning.}
{23010}{}{Bye.}
{24000}{}{They are a lawless group who pretend to be some people from the
 far past.}
{24010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{25000}{}{He leads the Khans.  He is one of the most dangerous men that
 has ever set eyes on Shady Sands.  He leads the raider clans with a heavy fist.}
{25010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{26000}{}{It's 4-6 days to the southwest.  Good trading occasionally, but
 more often than not, they try to stiff us.}
{26010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{27000}{}{You're standing in it.}
{27010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{28000}{}{Much farther to the south than Junktown.  The Hub is the largest
 city I've heard about.  Must be a thousand people there, at least.}
{28010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{29000}{}{She is the daughter of Aradesh.  Some day she could lead us, but
 she must learn to temper her ways.}
{29010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{30000}{}{He is the leader of our community, and a true hero.  You can always find him at work in the communal hall.}
{30010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{31000}{}{He works with Aradesh to make sure we are safe.}
{31010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{32000}{}{That is me. I am the doctor for Shady Sands.}
{32010}{}{Tell me more about...}
{33000}{}{error}
{34000}{}{error}
{35000}{}{Hello, again. How can I be of service?}
{35010}{}{Tell me about...}
{35020}{}{I need healing.}
{35030}{}{I've been poisoned!}
{35040}{}{What do you know about Radscorpions?}
{35050}{}{I have a sample of the Radscorpion poison, can you do 
something with it?}
{35060}{}{Hello again. Just stopping by.}
{36000}{}{Hmm, Tandi is gone? I find this hard to believe, but maybe
 she ran away with Seth. I know that they have been eyeing
 each other lately. Aradesh was always a little bit of a
 prude, perhaps it was too much for her finally.}
{36010}{}{Bye.}
{100000001}{}{Please do not take my things.}
{100000002}{}{You gain 250 experience points for helping make the antidote.}

